description:
Design a register with load and reset functionalities for a single-bit input. The register updates its output Q on the rising edge of the clock signal. When the reset signal is active, it sets Q to 0. If the load signal is active, Q takes the value of the input D. Otherwise, Q increments by the value of D, effectively functioning as a simple adder in conjunction with the clock.
